flowchart TD
    Student([Student])
    Professor([Professor])
    Advisor([Academic Advisor])
    Admin([IT Support Admin])

    subgraph Client [Client Side / User Interface]
        MobileApp[Mobile Web Browser]
        DesktopApp[Desktop Web Browser]
    end

    subgraph Controllers [Controller Layer]
        SecFilter[Role & Session Security Filter]
        AuthController[Authentication Controller]
        SessionController[Attendance Session Controller]
        CheckInController[Check-In Controller]
    end

    subgraph Services [Business Logic Layer]
        AuthService[User Authentication & Password Hashing Service]
        QRService[QR Code Generation & Validation]
        ReportService[Reporting Service]
        LogService[Security Logging Service]
    end

    subgraph Repository [Data Access Layer]
        UserRepo[User Repository]
        CourseRepo[Course Repository]
        AttendanceRepo[Attendance Record Repository]
        LogRepo[Security Log Repository]
    end

    Database[(Main Database - Encrypted Storage)]

    Student -->|Scans code| MobileApp
    Professor -->|Creates session / Uploads CSV| DesktopApp
    Advisor -->|Views assigned records| DesktopApp
    Admin -->|Checks logs / Manages users| DesktopApp

    MobileApp -->|HTTPS Encrypted Requests| SecFilter
    DesktopApp -->|HTTPS Encrypted Requests| SecFilter

    SecFilter --> AuthController
    SecFilter --> SessionController
    SecFilter --> CheckInController

    AuthController --> AuthService
    AuthController --> LogService
    SessionController --> QRService
    CheckInController --> QRService
    CheckInController --> LogService
    SessionController --> ReportService

    AuthService --> UserRepo
    QRService --> CourseRepo
    QRService --> AttendanceRepo
    ReportService --> AttendanceRepo
    ReportService --> CourseRepo
    LogService --> LogRepo

    UserRepo <--> Database
    CourseRepo <--> Database
    AttendanceRepo <--> Database
    LogRepo <--> Database
